window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Can't get enough Redneck Hijinks and Trailer Park Divas?</i></b></p> <p>Then you're in for a treat. Volume three of our popular anthology series is sure to scratch that questionable itch.</p> <p>With stories by Michael Knost, William Joseph Roberts, Philip K. Booker, Christopher Woods, D. Raymond Smith, David Badurina, H.P. Holo, James Palmer, Jason Cordova, Lee Ellis, M Leigh, Michael Morton, Michael Craig, and Guest Editorial by Faith Hunter.</p> <p>Pull off your boots, crack a cold one, and come sit with us for a <i>spell. </i>From Crossroad Demons to Vampires, you're sure to find a favorite tale or three in this collection.</p> <p><b>Full list of authors includes Michael Craig.</b></p>"; 
